k03 -- the EXTERNAL-FIELD SATURATION LAW in 8107 Galactic molecular clouds
       alpha_vir = 5 sigma_V^2 R/(G M)  vs  B(e) = nu(e)[1+L(e)/3],  e = G M_b,MW/(R_gal^2 a_0)
======================================================================================================================

  7999 clouds with complete entries; 4065 survive the resolution cut (angular radius > 0.25 deg and >= 20 pixels)
